ylhnQjB2Gds0IhmQkisPTTUOA&oe=6B06F295"}, {"file_name": "6.png", "id": "3851838375126572", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491822817_3851838378459905_3779463647198985173_n.png?_nc_cat=103&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=v4FJn8_aCGsQ7kNvwGjm7Ie&_nc_oc=AdpgRBaZoMBSd6npRhTl1mpstpKqRTHyp8I3C6Fm4I1qufFzlJ5siPnCr_TlDv3uWac&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSekE-dxixY7VdNjXgdeQ9hnc_H0FhK2bCq6LbvFs0JEw&oe=6B07113F"}, {"file_name": "3.png", "id": "1191950545947410", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824594_1191950549280743_7426481589409788274_n.png?_nc_cat=105&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=9OIG_2DIuZ0Q7kNvwH6m2KE&_nc_oc=AdoyKHhVG2YrtnSovIHssW9h5qJDwgZahxgkcPrU0QUDtwwkOi5H0X1RIfGGgByN9QI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQT1lEJ6JveCoph6PDQgFZGfs2_LuACCvDyKuW8ex7Ea3g&oe=6B06FD71"}, {"file_name": "2.png", "id": "1764073000844426", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491827277_1764073004177759_8944125592830904355_n.png?_nc_cat=110&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WMZ0RtWED_QQ7kNvwEoTKBT&_nc_oc=AdqnzdJJBiKIMbTw3uRlRQUjDh7H087ZCrS8b0xILlveAnie4cW4h752BcO-rvjne54&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSInzG1XQfPVf8PuWBd_m2xsqGFJO_72HRFnHUsU_KcnA&oe=6B07190E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "TrailerCover.png", "id": "1775058523531176", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491824307_1775058530197842_1248001474592057813_n.png?_nc_cat=100&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=tvmIfWal778Q7kNvwEchiU5&_nc_oc=AdrtpmfPofxF6Ibm_ctj2qnRhcS1bBIQnONCq5uVKFFUljklkHXm3td3ZgQzS2Pb5ho&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSNKS1cVi1hHaw87lSvek7aOj8a5-PouQdloVCykz5nDA&oe=6B0703D3"}, "display_name": "One More Delve", "keywords": ["Dungeon", "Medieval", "Zombie", "RPG", "Sword"], "long_description": "One More Delve is a physics-based VR dungeon crawler. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve into randomized dungeons.\n# Physics-Based Combat\nEngage in realistic melee combat where every slash, parry, and block matters. Feel the true weight of your weapons as you dismember your enemies.\n{2075948720015369}\n# Upgrade Your Character\nLoot new armor and weapons to configure your own playstyle. Choose from one- and two-handed swords, axes, bows, shields and spells to help you fight and explore your way towards the final boss of the dungeon.\n{2449503938858684}{1952446932077468}\n# Social Hub Server\nBetween dungeon runs, relax in the social hub, interact with other players and use the materials you've gathered to craft new weapons and armor.\n{2204437950295197}\nJoin a party or beat the dungeon as a solo adventurer.\n{967269222704290}\n\n **Talk to the developer and join the community:** Discord.gg/GC4CqRebvF", "short_description": "One More Delve is a physics-based VR dungeon crawler. Fight, loot, and survive in up to 3 player co-op as you delve into randomized dungeons.\n\n- Wield one- and two-handed weapons, bows, shields and spells\n- Master physics-based combat to slash, bash and dismember your enemies\n- Team up in 3-player co-op to conquer the dungeons together\n- Loot new armor and weapons to configure your own playstyle\n- Return to the social hub to craft gear and plan your next dungeon run"}]}, "developer_name": "ATVR", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://github.com/W1zurd/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy/blob/main/OneMoreDelvePrivacyPolicy.txt", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ATVR", "support_website_url": "https://discord.com/invite/GC4CqRebvF", "website_url": "https://atvrgames.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [